# name: Where good products come from
# blurb: A three-set venn diagram with a highlighted overlap.
title "Where good products come from"
layout venn
paper graph
pen ballpoint
seed 3

set design "Design"
set code "Code"
set words "Writing"

- Sketches in design
- Tests in code
- Docs in words
- Prototypes in design & code
- UX copy in design & words
- Comments in code & words
- Great products in design & code & words
highlight design&code&words
